# Kitchen sink {#kitchen-sink .demo}

A paragraph with /italic/, *bold*, `code`, and a [link](https://example.com).

Reference-style: [the example][ex] elsewhere.

[ex]: https://example.com

Autolink: <https://markup-carve.github.io/carve/>.

## Lists

- Item with `inline code`
- Item with [a link](#kitchen-sink)

  - Nested

    - Deeper

1. First {.first}
2. Second
3. Third

## Tables

| Col 1 | Col 2 |
|-------|-------|
| a     | b     |
| c     | d     |

## Carve extras

*[HTML]: HyperText Markup Language
*[CSS]: Cascading Style Sheets

Inline extensions: :kbd[Ctrl] and :mark[important].

Thanks to @alice and #release-1.0 for the review.

